# Korea Ish E'lonlari — Telegram Job Aggregator Bot

A production-grade Telegram userbot that monitors multiple Uzbek job-related
groups in South Korea and automatically forwards matching job posts to the
**Korea Ish E'lonlari** target group. Built with Telethon (userbot) and
aiogram (admin panel), deployed on Railway with a persistent SQLite database.

