## Project Structure

```
.
├── main.py                  # Unified entry point — runs everything
├── main_monitor.py          # Standalone monitor only
├── main_admin.py            # Standalone admin bot only
├── generate_session.py      # Interactive session string generator
├── fix_chat_ids.py          # One-time DB migration for bad chat IDs
├── railway.toml             # Railway deployment config
├── requirements.txt
└── bot/
    ├── config.py            # Environment variable loader
    ├── client.py            # Telethon client instances
    ├── database.py          # SQLite layer + in-memory cache
    ├── filters.py           # Multilingual keyword engine
    ├── monitor.py           # NewMessage handler factory (dual-account)
    ├── admin_bot.py         # aiogram v3 admin panel + FSM flows
    ├── notifier.py          # Admin DM error notifications
    ├── scheduler.py         # Daily 9 PM KST summary
    └── utils.py             # Logging, message formatter, safe_send_message
```

